"If checked, a learning artifact of this school must have a phase before it "
"can be submitted."
msgstr ""
"Jika dicentang, artefak pembelajaran sekolah ini harus memiliki fase sebelum "
"dapat diajukan."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school__learning_artifact_require_component
msgid ""
"If checked, a learning artifact of this school must have a primary component "
"before it can be submitted."
msgstr ""
"Jika dicentang, artefak pembelajaran sekolah ini harus memiliki komponen "
"primer sebelum dapat diajukan."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact_showcase_stage__require_eligible
msgid ""
"If checked, an artifact can move into this stage only when the category of "
"its curation status is Eligible."
msgstr ""
"Jika dicentang, artefak hanya dapat pindah ke tahap ini bila kategori status "
"kurasinya adalah Memenuhi Syarat."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact_showcase_stage__require_publication_consent
msgid ""
"If checked, an artifact can move into this stage only when the parental "
"consent allows the showcase, following the consent policy of its school."
msgstr ""
"Jika dicentang, artefak hanya dapat pindah ke tahap ini bila izin orang tua "
"mengizinkan etalase, sesuai kebijakan izin sekolahnya."

