#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school__showcase_exclude_refused_member
msgid ""
"If checked, the students who refused the publication are left out when the "
"publication consent of an artifact is checked for the showcase, as long as "
"one student remains. They must then not be recognizable in the content."
msgstr ""
"Jika dicentang, siswa yang menolak publikasi dikecualikan saat izin "
"publikasi artefak diperiksa untuk etalase, selama masih ada satu siswa yang "
"tersisa. Mereka kemudian tidak boleh dapat dikenali dalam konten."

