"Odoo."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_distinctive_program__component_ids
msgid "The components that make up this program."
msgstr "Komponen yang menyusun program ini."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__production_ids
msgid "The content produced for each channel of the showcase."
msgstr "Konten yang diproduksi untuk setiap kanal etalase."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__rubric_id
msgid ""
"The curation rubric of the artifact. It is the active rubric of the school, "
"or the fallback rubric without schools when the school has none."
msgstr ""
"Rubrik kurasi artefak. Yaitu rubrik aktif sekolah, atau rubrik cadangan "
"tanpa sekolah bila sekolah tidak memilikinya."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__curation_status_id
msgid ""
"The curation status derived from the ethics result, the knockout aspects and "
"the total score."
msgstr ""
"Status kurasi yang diturunkan dari hasil etika, aspek gugur, dan total skor."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: code:addons/ssi_school_learning_artifact/models/school_learning_artifact.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "The curation status of the artifact is not eligible"
msgstr "Status kurasi artefak tidak memenuhi syarat"

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact_showcase_production__date_published
msgid "The date the content was distributed outside Odoo."
msgstr "Tanggal konten didistribusikan di luar Odoo."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__date
msgid "The date the learning activity or achievement took place."
msgstr "Tanggal kegiatan atau pencapaian pembelajaran berlangsung."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_distinctive_program_component__program_id
msgid ""
"The distinctive program this component belongs to. The component is deleted "
"together with the program."
msgstr ""
"Program unggulan tempat komponen ini berada. Komponen dihapus bersama "
"programnya."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__primary_component_id
msgid ""
"The dominant component of the distinctive program that this artifact "
"supports. Required when the school requires a component."
msgstr ""
"Komponen dominan dari program unggulan yang didukung artefak ini. Wajib "
"diisi bila sekolah mensyaratkan komponen."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__graduate_profile_id
msgid ""
"The first active graduate profile, by sequence, that covers the grade of the "
"class. Filled automatically."
msgstr ""
"Profil lulusan aktif pertama, menurut urutan, yang mencakup tingkat "
"dari kelas tersebut. Diisi otomatis."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__grade_id
msgid "The grade level of the selected class, filled automatically."
msgstr "Tingkat dari kelas yang dipilih, diisi otomatis."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__grade_type_id
msgid "The grade type of the selected class, filled automatically."
msgstr "Jenis tingkat dari kelas yang dipilih, diisi otomatis."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_graduate_profile__grade_ids
msgid "The grades covered by this graduate profile."
msgstr "Tingkat yang dicakup oleh profil lulusan ini."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__grade_class_id
msgid ""
"The homeroom class of the students. Only classes of the selected school can "
"be chosen."
msgstr ""
"Kelas wali dari para siswa. Hanya kelas dari sekolah yang dipilih yang dapat "
"dipilih."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__media_type
msgid "The kind of media that documents the activity."
msgstr "Jenis media yang mendokumentasikan kegiatan."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact_score__artifact_id
msgid "The learning artifact that this score belongs to."
msgstr "Artefak pembelajaran pemilik skor ini."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact_showcase_production__artifact_id
msgid "The learning artifact this content is produced for."
msgstr "Artefak pembelajaran tempat konten ini diproduksi."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__dimension_id
msgid ""
"The learning dimension covered by this artifact. Required when the school "
"requires a dimension."
msgstr ""
"Dimensi pembelajaran yang dicakup artefak ini. Wajib diisi bila sekolah "
"mensyaratkan dimensi."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__phase_id
msgid ""
"The learning phase covered by this artifact. Required when the school "
"requires a phase."
msgstr ""
"Fase pembelajaran yang dicakup artefak ini. Wajib diisi bila sekolah "
"mensyaratkan fase."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__achievement_level
msgid "The level at which an achievement was reached, if any."
msgstr "Tingkat pencapaian yang diraih, bila ada."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact_rubric__threshold_ids
msgid ""
"The minimum total scores and the status each one gives. The highest minimum "
"that the total reaches wins."
msgstr ""
"Total skor minimum dan status yang diberikan oleh masing-masing. Minimum "
"tertinggi yang dicapai total akan dipakai."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: code:addons/ssi_school_learning_artifact/models/school_learning_artifact.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "The parental consent does not allow the showcase"
msgstr "Izin orang tua tidak mengizinkan etalase"

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__ethics_reason_id
msgid "The reason why the artifact failed the ethics gate."
msgstr "Alasan artefak gagal pada gerbang etika."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: code:addons/ssi_school_learning_artifact/models/school_learning_artifact.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "The responsible user assessed the artifact"
msgstr "Pengguna penanggung jawab menilai artefak"

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact_score__criterion_id
msgid "The rubric aspect that this score rates."
msgstr "Aspek rubrik yang dinilai oleh skor ini."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact_rubric_criterion__rubric_id
msgid "The rubric that this aspect belongs to."
msgstr "Rubrik tempat aspek ini berada."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact_rubric_threshold__rubric_id
msgid "The rubric that this threshold belongs to."
msgstr "Rubrik tempat ambang ini berada."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__school_id
msgid ""
"The school unit that owns this artifact. Its configuration decides which "
"fields are required and which master data can be selected."
msgstr ""
"Unit sekolah pemilik artefak ini. Konfigurasinya menentukan bidang mana yang "
"wajib diisi dan data master mana yang dapat dipilih."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact_area__school_id
msgid "The school unit that owns this learning area."
msgstr "Unit sekolah pemilik bidang pembelajaran ini."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_res_partner_consent__school_id
msgid ""
"The school unit this consent applies to. Leave it empty for a consent that "
"does not concern a school."
msgstr ""
"Unit sekolah tempat izin ini berlaku. Kosongkan untuk izin yang tidak "
"berkaitan dengan sekolah."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact_score__score
msgid "The score given to the aspect. Zero means the aspect is not scored yet."
msgstr "Skor yang diberikan untuk aspek. Nol berarti aspek belum dinilai."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__score_ids
msgid "The scores of the aspects of the rubric."
msgstr "Skor dari aspek-aspek rubrik."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__activity_stage
msgid "The stage of the activity that the media captures."
msgstr "Tahap kegiatan yang diabadikan oleh media."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__showcase_stage_id
msgid ""
"The stage of the artifact on the showcase board. Moving into a stage may "
"require an eligible curation status, a publication consent that allows the "
"showcase, or membership of a group, as configured on the stage. Every move "
"is logged in the chatter with the user and the time."
msgstr ""
"Tahap artefak pada papan etalase. Perpindahan ke suatu tahap dapat "
"mensyaratkan status kurasi yang memenuhi syarat, izin publikasi yang "
"mengizinkan etalase, atau keanggotaan dalam suatu grup, sesuai konfigurasi "
"tahap tersebut. Setiap perpindahan dicatat di chatter beserta pengguna dan "
"waktunya."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__assessment_consent
msgid ""
"The strictest parental consent of the students of this artifact to assess it "
"internally, of the school of the artifact."
msgstr ""
"Izin orang tua paling ketat dari para siswa artefak ini untuk menilainya "
"secara internal, pada sekolah artefak."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__inventory_consent
msgid ""
"The strictest parental consent of the students of this artifact to keep it "
"in the inventory, of the school of the artifact."
msgstr ""
"Izin orang tua paling ketat dari para siswa artefak ini untuk menyimpannya "
"dalam inventaris, pada sekolah artefak."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__publication_consent
msgid ""
"The strictest parental consent of the students of this artifact to publish "
"it, of the school of the artifact."
msgstr ""
"Izin orang tua paling ketat dari para siswa artefak ini untuk "
"mempublikasikannya, pada sekolah artefak."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__promotion_consent
msgid ""
"The strictest parental consent of the students of this artifact to use it "
"for promotion, of the school of the artifact."
msgstr ""
"Izin orang tua paling ketat dari para siswa artefak ini untuk menggunakannya "
"sebagai promosi, pada sekolah artefak."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__student_ids
msgid ""
"The students featured in this artifact. At least one student is required "
"before the artifact can be submitted."
msgstr ""
"Siswa yang ditampilkan dalam artefak ini. Setidaknya satu siswa diperlukan "
"sebelum artefak dapat diajukan."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__limited_publication_student_ids
msgid ""
"The students who allow the publication of this artifact only in a limited "
"way. Check their preference before publishing."
msgstr ""
"Siswa yang mengizinkan publikasi artefak ini hanya secara terbatas. Periksa "
"preferensi mereka sebelum mempublikasikan."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__refused_publication_student_ids
msgid "The students who withdrew the consent to publish this artifact."
msgstr "Siswa yang menarik izin untuk mempublikasikan artefak ini."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__student_reflection
msgid "The students' reflection on the activity."
msgstr "Refleksi para siswa tentang kegiatan."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__learning_area_id
msgid ""
"The subject, activity area, development area or competition field of this "
"artifact. Required before the artifact can be submitted."
msgstr ""
"Mata pelajaran, bidang aktivitas, bidang pengembangan, atau bidang kompetisi "
"dari artefak ini. Wajib diisi sebelum artefak dapat diajukan."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__total_score
msgid "The sum of the scores of all aspects."
msgstr "Jumlah skor dari semua aspek."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__teacher_reflection
msgid "The teacher's reflection on the activity."
msgstr "Refleksi guru tentang kegiatan."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact_showcase_production__content
msgid "The text produced for the channel."
msgstr "Teks yang diproduksi untuk kanal."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__date_curated
msgid "The time the curation was finished."
msgstr "Waktu kurasi diselesaikan."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact_score__date_score
msgid "The time the score was given."
msgstr "Waktu skor diberikan."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_partner_consent_purpose__learning_artifact_usage
msgid ""
"The usage of a learning artifact that this purpose covers. Leave it empty "
"when the purpose does not concern learning artifacts."
msgstr ""
"Penggunaan artefak pembelajaran yang dicakup tujuan ini. Kosongkan bila "
"tujuan tidak berkaitan dengan artefak pembelajaran."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact_showcase_production__pic_id
msgid "The user in charge of producing this content."
msgstr "Pengguna yang bertanggung jawab memproduksi konten ini."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__curated_by_id
msgid "The user who finished the curation."
msgstr "Pengguna yang menyelesaikan kurasi."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact_score__assessor_id
msgid "The user who gave the score."
msgstr "Pengguna yang memberikan skor."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__consent_reviewed_by_id
msgid "The user who marked the limited consent as reviewed."
msgstr "Pengguna yang menandai izin terbatas sebagai telah ditinjau."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__ethics_assessor_id
msgid "The user who set the ethics result."
msgstr "Pengguna yang menetapkan hasil etika."

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact_rubric__threshold_ids
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_school_learning_artifact.school_learning_artifact_rubric_view_form
msgid "Thresholds"
msgstr "Ambang"

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__total_score
msgid "Total Score"
msgstr "Total Skor"

#. module: ssi_school_learning_artifact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_learning_artifact.field_school_learning_artifact__name
msgid ""
"Transaction/document number\n"
"\n"
"* Unique indentifer of transaction\n"
"* Leave '/' to automatically generate number\n"
"* Change '/' into any number/identifier to manually assign number.\n"
"  Manual number assignment can be done in 'Draft' state\n"
"  Only user with 'Can Manualy Assign Number' policy can manually assign "
"number.\n"
"* Transaction with number other than '/' can not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Nomor transaksi/dokumen\n"
"\n"
"* Pengenal unik transaksi\n"
"* Biarkan '/' untuk menghasilkan nomor secara otomatis\n"
"* Ubah '/' menjadi nomor/pengenal apa pun untuk menetapkan nomor "
"secara manual.\n"
"  Penetapan nomor manual dapat dilakukan dalam status 'Draf'\n"
"  Hanya pengguna dengan kebijakan 'Dapat Memasukkan Nomor Dokumen "
"Manual' yang dapat menetapkan nomor secara manual.\n"
"* Transaksi dengan nomor selain '/' tidak dapat dihapus."

